    "text": "Arrange the following given acids in decreasing order of their Ka values<br />\r<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>)</mo></math>"
